msgstr "Qayb kasta waxaa lagu shubaa kaydkaaga waxaana laga saaraa seerfarkan ka hor inta aan la samayn qaybta xigta, markaa koobiga kaydku marnaba meel kama qaato martigelintaada."

#: includes/class-admin.php:307
