msgid "Passphrase"
msgstr "Weerada sirta ah"

#: includes/class-admin.php:315
msgid "I understand this replaces this site’s files and database with the backup’s. Files that are not in the backup are kept."
msgstr "Waan fahamsanahay in tani ay ku beddelayso faylashan iyo kaydka xogta goobtan kuwa ku jira kaydka koobiyeynta. Faylasha aan ku jirin kaydka koobiyeynta waa la xafidayaa."

#: includes/class-admin.php:321
